    "title": "Missing Cheraw mother and her 2 young children found safe - NewsBreak",
    "text": "CHESTERFIELD COUNTY, S.C. ( QUEEN CITY NEWS ) — The Chesterfield County Sheriff’s Office says a missing Cheraw mother and her two young children have been found safe. On July 9, authorities said Payton Manus, 23, of Cheraw, had not been seen or heard from since July 3. She was believed to be with her two young children, 1-year-old Addeline Sterrett and 2-month-old Nathaniel Sterrett. Authorities confirm they have since been found safe. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to Queen City News.",
